WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.490
A heavy flywheel spins inside a machine,
carrying a lot of angular momentum.

2
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.180
A brake pad presses against its rim.

3
00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.720
The pad warms up.

4
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:14.210
The wheel slows, and within seconds
it comes to a complete stop.

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.460
All that angular momentum
has vanished from the wheel.

6
00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.020
Where has it gone?

7
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:23.320
In this mission, you'll read changes in
angular momentum straight off torque and

8
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.490
time graphs.

9
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.870
Then you'll sit a student on a free stool,

10
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.910
spinning a bicycle wheel, and
decide which system to watch.

11
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.870
Your mission: find out what happens to
the angular momentum the flywheel loses.
